// Adversarial stress: Sympathy at 3 stacks under sustained chaos input — Dense layout.
//
// At stack 3, cascade_depth reaches 2 (depth_increase_interval=2 default, so
// 1 + (3-1)/2 = 2). Every bolt bump triggers a two-ring BFS heal cascade over
// the Dense cluster. The adversarial risks:
//
//   1. Multi-ring BFS racing the death pipeline: if a cell is hit, Dead-marked,
//      and then reached as ring-1 OR ring-2 neighbour in the same tick, the BFS
//      emits a HealDealt<Cell> for a despawned entity. The system's snapshot
//      exclusion of Dead cells must hold under concurrent damage bursts.
//
//   2. Geometric ring attenuation NaN: ring-2 amount = amount * factor^2. If
//      factor is 0.0 (stack 0 guard bypassed) or amount itself is NaN from a
//      prior arithmetic fault, the product is NaN and propagates into HealDealt.
//
//   3. Entity leak from bulk HealDealt<Cell> writes: at stack 3, a Dense layout
//      can produce O(neighbours) heals per bump per ring. Chaos drives rapid
//      consecutive bumps, so message entities can accumulate if the write/read
//      cycle has an off-by-one in cleanup ordering.
//
//   4. Breaker OOB under chaos: action_prob 0.7 drives rapid direction flips
//      and dashes; the BFS heal computation must not stall the physics tick
//      long enough to allow the breaker to tunnel through a wall boundary.
//
// 3000 frames with allow_early_end: false ensures the Dense cluster is worked
// through multiple restock cycles, keeping the BFS snapshot non-trivial for
// the entire run. 32 runs explore varied bolt trajectories, cell-damage
// ordering, and BFS frontier shapes.
(
    breaker: "Aegis",
    layout: "Dense",
    input: Chaos((action_prob: 0.7)),
    max_frames: 3000,
    disallowed_failures: [
        BoltInBounds,
        BreakerInBounds,
        HazardStackValid,
        NoEntityLeaks,
        NoNaN,
    ],
    allowed_failures: None,
    debug_setup: None,
    allow_early_end: false,
    stress: (runs: 32, parallelism: 32),
    seed: 8831,
    frame_mutations: [
        (frame: 5, mutation: InjectHazardStack(kind_name: "Sympathy", stacks: 3)),
    ],
)
